# Optional — "Reportar problema" email (Resend) + local SQLite history
# Create the Resend account and API key yourself (never commit the real key).
# https://resend.com
#
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxx
# REPORT_PROBLEM_TO=juliopdcosta@gmail.com
# REPORT_PROBLEM_FROM=Sr. Atlas <onboarding@resend.dev>
#
# Reports are always saved locally in SQLite (problem_reports table):
#   ATLAS_SQLITE_PATH=.../atlas.db   (default: backend/data/atlas.db)
#
# Without RESEND_API_KEY the email fails honestly (no fake "enviado"),
# but the report remains in the local registry.
#
# This feature never triggers automatic code changes or Cursor agents.
